  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>The KOALA 500 is a refrigerated insulated container designed for the safe and reliable transport of temperature-controlled products, ensuring maximum thermal efficiency and flexibility. Internal capacity: 500 liters, ideal for transporting fresh or frozen goods Durable material: Made from robust, highly insulating polyethylene, suitable for intensive use Thermal insulation: Eco-friendly polyurethane foam, free of CFCs [&hellip;]</p>\n",
